.TH ZVM 1 "August 2026" "ZVM" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
zvm \- manage installed Zig and ZLS versions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zvm
.RI [ global-options ]
.I command
.RI [ command-options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B zvm
downloads, installs, selects, and removes Zig compiler versions.
It can also install a compatible ZLS release, run a command with a Zig version
without selecting it globally, and use alternative version maps or mirrors.
.PP
Zig installations and ZVM state are stored under
.IR ~/.zvm
by default.
Set
.B ZVM_PATH
to use another base directory.
.SH GLOBAL OPTIONS
.TP
.BR --color " " mode
Set colored output.
.I mode
may be
.BR on ,
.BR yes ,
.BR y ,
.BR enabled ,
.BR true ,
.BR off ,
.BR no ,
.BR n ,
.BR disabled ,
or
.BR false .
If the value is omitted, toggle the saved setting.
.TP
.BR -h , " " --help
Show help.
.TP
.BR -v , " " --version
Print the ZVM version and target platform.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.BR install ", " i
Download and install a Zig version, optionally with ZLS.
See
.BR zvm-install (1).
.TP
.B use
Select an installed Zig version.
See
.BR zvm-use (1).
.TP
.B run
Run Zig from a selected version without changing the current version.
See
.BR zvm-run (1).
.TP
.BR list-remote ", " ls-remote
List Zig versions available from the configured version map.
See
.BR zvm-list-remote (1).
.TP
.BR list ", " ls
List installed Zig versions.
See
.BR zvm-list (1).
.TP
.BR alias ", " kv
Create, inspect, or remove names for installed Zig versions.
See
.BR zvm-alias (1).
.TP
.BR uninstall ", " rm
Remove an installed Zig version.
See
.BR zvm-uninstall (1).
.TP
.B clean
Remove downloaded build archives from the ZVM base directory.
See
.BR zvm-clean (1).
.TP
.B upgrade
Upgrade ZVM itself when self-upgrades are enabled in the build.
See
.BR zvm-upgrade (1).
.TP
.B mirrorlist
Select the mirror-list URL used for Zig downloads.
See
.BR zvm-mirrorlist (1).
.TP
.B bug
Start a bug report with the current environment prefilled.
See
.BR zvm-bug (1).
.TP
.B version
Print the installed ZVM version.
See
.BR zvm-version (1).
.TP
.B vmu
Configure Zig and ZLS version-map sources.
See
.BR zvm-vmu (1).
.TP
.B completion
Generate a shell completion script.
See
.BR zvm-completion (1).
.SH VERSION ARGUMENTS
Commands that accept a Zig version support exact releases such as
.BR 0.14.1 ,
the development channel
.BR master ,
and development build identifiers.
.PP
Release shorthand such as
.B 0.14
or
.B .14
selects the newest matching patch release.
The
.B stable
shorthand selects the newest stable release.
Selection and removal resolve shorthand against installed versions;
installation may resolve it against the remote version map.
User-defined aliases may be used where version arguments are accepted.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B ZVM_PATH
ZVM base directory. Defaults to
.IR ~/.zvm .
.TP
.B ZVM_INSTALL
Directory containing the ZVM executable for self-upgrades.
.TP
.B ZVM_TARGET_OS
Override the operating system selected for an installation download.
.TP
.B ZVM_TARGET_ARCH
Override the architecture selected for an installation download.
.TP
.B ZVM_HTTP_TIMEOUT
HTTP timeout in seconds for installation requests.
.TP
.B ZVM_SET_CU
If set, disable the automatic ZVM upgrade check.
.TP
.B ZVM_DEBUG
If set, enable debug logging.
.TP
.B ZVM_SKIP_TLS_VERIFY
If set, disable TLS certificate verification for downloads.
The value
.B no-warn
also suppresses the warning.
.TP
.B BROWSER
Command used by
.BR zvm-bug (1)
to open a report URL.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.zvm/settings.json
Persistent ZVM settings.
.TP
.I ~/.zvm/aliases.json
Version aliases used by
.BR zvm-alias (1).
.TP
.I ~/.zvm/bin/zig
Link to the currently selected Zig executable on Unix-like systems.
.TP
.I ~/.zvm/bin/zls
Link to the selected ZLS executable, when installed.
.PP
When
.B ZVM_PATH
is set, these paths are relative to that directory instead of
.IR ~/.zvm .
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
zvm install 0.14.1
zvm install --zls master
zvm use stable
zvm run 0.13 build test
zvm ls
zvm alias work 0.14.1
.EE
.SH BUGS
Report issues at
.UR https://github.com/tristanisham/zvm/issues/
.UE .
.SH AUTHOR
Tristan Isham and ZVM contributors.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR zig (1),
.BR zvm-install (1),
.BR zvm-use (1),
.BR zvm-run (1),
.BR zvm-list (1),
.BR zvm-alias (1)
